# Environment
# .env holds publishable/browser-side config only (Supabase publishable key,
# Google Maps browser key) and is intentionally tracked so the app builds from
# a fresh clone. Anything secret belongs in Supabase secrets, never here.
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# Local QA tooling (Playwright crawls, reports, auth state, .env.qa)
qa-guards/
